==English==
[[Image:Arcosu07.jpg|thumb|carob tree]]
[[Image:Carobs.JPG|thumb|carob fruits]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{m|fr|carobe}}, from {{etyl|ar|en}} {{m|ar|خَرُّوب||locust bean pod}}, from {{etyl|aii|en}} {{m|aii|||tr=kharubu}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[evergreen]] [[shrub]] or [[tree]], ''[[Ceratonia siliqua]]'', native to the [[Mediterranean]] region.
# The fruit of that tree.
# A sweet chocolate-like confection made with the pulp of the fruit.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|tree}} {{l|en|St. John's bread}}
* {{sense|fruit}} {{l|en|locust bean}}

